1. Executive Summary & Application Overview
1.1 Purpose and Scope
The Recourse Operations Database is an enterprise-grade web application built to manage the end-to-end lifecycle of mortgage recourse operations, mortgage insurance (MI) claims and reviews, repurchase defense workflows, batch file requests, and comprehensive multi-tier Quality Control (QC) compliance auditing.

The system serves as a central repository and operational processing engine connecting multiple lending business units, servicing portfolios, and external mortgage investors/agencies (e.g., Fannie Mae, Freddie Mac, FHA, VA, Private Investors).

