Browser Navigation Warning: An alert banner is present across all forms:
WARNING: Please do not use Back button in the Internet Explorer menu. Users must exclusively utilize on-screen navigation buttons (GoBack, Go Home, Go Back to Loan Search, Reset, Submit) to prevent APEX session state corruption.

