5. Operational Workflows & User Guides
5.1 End-to-End Repurchase Defense Lifecycle
Claim Intake: Operator searches for the target loan in Repurchase Defense > Loan Search or creates a new defense record via Create Repurchase Defense.
Data Enrichment: Master loan attributes automatically populate from LOAN_DETAIL. Operator verifies investor demand criteria against note terms and closing packages.
Rebuttal Formulation: Operator enters defense arguments, cites compensating factors, attaches rebuttals, updates Defense Status, and saves the record.
Audit Sign-off: Supervisory manager reviews defense package and authorizes transmission to the investor.
5.2 End-to-End QC Worksheet Audit Lifecycle
Assignment: QC Processor receives file and assigns file to a QC Underwriter on Review Info.
Credit & Capacity Re-Verification: Underwriter audits borrower income and liabilities in Qualifying Info, verifies employment checkboxes, and clicks Calculate to compare Operations DTI vs QC DTI.
Collateral & Asset Re-Underwriting: Underwriter inspects appraiser licensing, HUD/Freddie eligibility, and asset deposits on Collateral & Asset Info.
Exception Citing: If guidelines are breached, underwriter enters defects on Citings, setting Citing Code, Severity Level, and explanatory comments.
Review Conclusion: Underwriter logs notification letters (Letters 1-14) on Review Info, enters Review Comment and Final Comment, and submits the audit for manager approval.
6. Knowledge Transfer (KT) Handover Checklist & Support Guide
6.1 Daily Operations & Triage
 Batch File Requests: Monitor File Request Batch Details daily for stalled batches in Submitted status.
 Audit Exception Clearing: Ensure underwriters clear PHH Resolved? checkboxes when borrower rebuttals satisfy open citings.
 Data Integrity Safeguard: Remind all operational personnel never to click browser back buttons; enforce on-screen APEX navigation.
6.2 Maintenance & Troubleshooting
 Lookup Table Updates: When new loan programs or investor codes are introduced, use Administration > Manage Drop Down List to add lookup values without code deployments.
 User Provisioning: New analysts and underwriters must be assigned appropriate business unit roles in Manage Users.
 Audit Trail Inquiries: For regulatory examinations or internal audits, query Recourse Operations History (Page 502) or Investor Details History (Page 8) by application number or date range.
